	quest.177827BB58BC9179.quest_desc: [
		"Integrated Dynamics lets you build logic networks: read values from the world, run them through operators and act on the results."
		""
		"It starts with menril trees and a few simple machines, then moves to cables, readers and writers. Grab some bone meal to help menril grow."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 16 x Bone Meal and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
