	quest.1C7784570DCA72A6.quest_desc: [
		"The Logic Programmer is where you write variable cards. Pick an operator (like \"greater than\" or \"item count\"), plug in values and write it to a card."
		""
		"§eFirst project:§r make a card that reads a chest's item count and shows it on a Display Panel."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Logic Programmer and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
